I turn on the gas stove.
I put a pan on the stove.
Now, I remember the recipe video.
I repeat the steps of the recipe to myself.
"First, put two spoons of oil in the pan."
I put two spoons of oil in the pan.
The oil slowly becomes hot.
"Then, fry the peanuts."
I put some peanuts in the hot oil.
I fry them well.
The colour of the peanuts changes.
I take them out onto a plate.
"After that, put mustard seeds in the hot oil."
I add one small spoon of mustard seeds.
The mustard seeds start popping loudly.
"Now, mix the chopped onions and green chilies in it."
I carefully put the onions and chilies in the pan.
I stir them with a spoon.
A very good smell comes from the pan.
